Name = "Album Downloader"
Description = "Searches for an album, picks the highest quality folder (FLAC, with MP3 as a fallback) and downloads it to an \"Artist - Album\" folder in your music folder.\n\nUsage:\n- search bar: album: Artist - Album\n- chat: /album Artist - Album\n- /album-list shows the other folders found\n- /album-pick <number> downloads a different folder"
